<%- include('dash-header') %><a class="dash-back" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/projects') %>">← Living projects</a><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">GIVE THE WORK A SHARED HOME</p><h1>What are you moving forward?</h1><p class="heading-description">Start with a name and a goal. The details can grow with your conversations.</p></div></div><section class="dash-panel compose-panel"><% if(error) { %><p class="message error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><form class="compose-form" method="post" action="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/projects') %>" data-pending-label="Creating project…"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="request_id" value="<%= requestId %>"><label for="project-title">Project name</label><input id="project-title" name="title" maxlength="160" required value="<%= values.title||'' %>" placeholder="e.g. The autumn trip"><label for="project-goal">What would a useful outcome look like?</label><textarea id="project-goal" name="goal" maxlength="12000" rows="5" placeholder="The goal, the important constraints, and what you want to decide…"><%= values.goal||'' %></textarea><label for="project-agents">Assistants who can access this project <small>Optional; leave blank for all your connected assistants</small></label><input id="project-agents" name="allowed_agents" maxlength="1024" value="<%= values.allowed_agents||'' %>" placeholder="e.g. maya, charlie"><p class="compose-hint">One connection is enough to continue this project across calls. These optional limits control which connection labels can retrieve it.</p><button type="submit" class="dash-button lime">Create living project →</button></form></section><%- include('dash-footer') %>